		(uuid "2b47370c-6969-4ae3-a420-55aa51607300")
	)
	(text_box "C15 maximum height <= 7.7mm to leave space for the vent"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 104.14 0)
		(size 34.29 6.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2fe75eb2-3992-4a01-a0b9-2d26a83440d6")
	)
	(text_box "This is a 2mA current limiter with approximately 1.3V dropout (transistor + R3).\n\nWhen the voltage of R3 reaches 0.7V, at about 2mA, D4 starts conducting and it sucks away the current from the base.\n\nD3 is for protecting the transistor against reverse base-emitter voltage when the bus is in a low state. The D1 diode bridge at the front prevents backpowering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 48.26 0)
		(size 48.26 25.4)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "352743c7-a96c-4b88-8558-1260dd6dfb92")
	)
	(text_box "When the bus is high, we charge this buffer through the 2mA current limiter. When the bus is low (0.833ms), it powers the board.\n\nUnder normal conditions:\n  Minimum: 6.7V\n  Typical: 13.4V\n  Maximum: 19.9V\n\nD6 protects TPS62932 from >30V input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 48.26 0)
		(size 43.18 26.67)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4c223ab3-41a8-4ee4-a721-febf2d79ef10")
	)
	(text_box "D2 is for catching smaller, low-energy voltage spikes.\n\nD5 protects against accidental 230Vac connection to the bus. In case that happens, D5 starts conducting between 25V and 40V, causing overcurrent and F1 to blow.\n\nIdle bus current: 2 mA, during transmission: 85 mA mean, 260 mA peak.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.91 48.26 0)
		(size 38.1 26.67)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82f795ad-8e4b-4b2a-8288-80009506c1c4")
	)
	(text_box "R10 prevents driving the bus during bootup"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.53 144.78 0)
		(size 25.4 6.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
